00:07:55.341 --> 00:07:58.778
so that as a place more emphasis on

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:00.413
maneuver

00:08:00.413 --> 00:08:02.615
and in shaping the battlefield with fires

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:04.283
and then maneuvering,

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:05.251
there's a good chance

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:07.353
that they'll require less less

00:08:08.054 --> 00:08:09.188
artillery munitions.

00:08:09.188 --> 00:08:10.890
But that's left to be seen.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.725
So we're going to do everything we can

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:13.626
to make sure that they have

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:15.828
what they need to be successful.

00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:16.762
And that's what we continue

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:17.530
to emphasize

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.865
here in the Ukrainian

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:20.766
Defense Contact Group.

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:22.768
And and we think

00:08:22.768 --> 00:08:24.303
the training will pay

00:08:24.303 --> 00:08:26.272
additional dividends as well.

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:28.474
So thank you for it. Floor.

