What is

00:08:59.839 --> 00:09:02.642
your risk assessment for supply routes

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:07.079
or for the delivery of Western equipment

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:08.814
and ammunition

00:09:08.814 --> 00:09:09.615
