00:10:08.908 --> 00:10:09.442
So that's

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:11.444
that's really the focus of our hour

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:12.745
of our conversation today.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.281
So the metro lines

00:10:15.281 --> 00:10:16.148
