00:10:16.148 --> 00:10:18.451
in warfare and combat are always subject

00:10:18.451 --> 00:10:19.619
to enemy attack.

00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:21.687
No, no, different here.

00:10:21.687 --> 00:10:22.888
And the lines of communication

00:10:22.888 --> 00:10:24.590
that stretched through the western

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.858
portions of Ukraine

00:10:25.858 --> 00:10:26.525
are subject

00:10:26.525 --> 00:10:27.760
to Russian attack, attack

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.527
from the air attack

00:10:28.527 --> 00:10:29.862
from artillery attack,

00:10:29.862 --> 00:10:31.397
from special operations forces, etc.

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:32.732
So the key

00:10:32.932 --> 00:10:35.401
to ensure that the supplies get through,

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:38.070
maintain good operational security,

