00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:49.348
The security

00:10:49.348 --> 00:10:50.282
from the Polish border

00:10:50.282 --> 00:10:51.450
or any other border,

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.152
Romanian border anywhere,

00:10:53.152 --> 00:10:54.720
that security is

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:55.988
